      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在坐标空间里,这个数组对应一个点 $M(x,y,z)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "以方程 $P(x,y,z)=0$ 的解为坐标的所有空间的点的集",
        "合,是某个图形 $\\Phi$. 就说这个方程给定图形 $\\Phi$,或是说这个方",
        "程是图形 $\\Phi$ 的方程."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 问题. 求过点 $M_1(x_1,y_1,",
        "z_1)$ 且与非零向量 $\\vec{n}=(a,b,c)$ 垂",
        "直的平面 $\\alpha$ 的方程*."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解. 对于平面 $\\alpha$ 内的任意点",
        "$M(x,y,z)$ $(M\\ne M_1)$,向量 $\\overrightarrow{M_1M}$",
        "垂直于向量 $\\vec{n}$ (图 10). 因此"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 10",
      "box": [
        845,
        401,
        422,
        395
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-g10-10"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 10",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\vec{n}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{M_1M}=0$　(1)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个等式当 $M=M_1$ 时也成立. 考虑到 $\\overrightarrow{M_1M}=(x-x_1,",
        "y-y_1,z-z_1)$ (§44,问题 2)和 $\\vec{n}=(a,b,c)$,从等式(1)得到",
        "(§42):",
        "$a(x-x_1)+b(y-y_1)+c(z-z_1)=0$.　(2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任何不属于平面 $\\alpha$ 的点 $N$ 的坐标,因为 $\\vec{n}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{M_1N}\\ne0$,不满",
        "足方程(2)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这样,每一个平面可以用三个变量的线性方程给定,变量",
        "的系数中至少有一个不等于零*."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 现在我们来证明,所有含有三个变量的一次方程在坐",
        "标空间里给定一个平面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们研究任意的一次方程:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": "note",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "* 如果直线 $AA_1$ 垂直于平面 $\\alpha$,称向量 $\\overrightarrow{AA_1}$ 垂直于这个平面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": "note",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "* 这样的方程以后称为一次方程."
      ]
    },
